WEBVTT

00:00:00.016 --> 00:00:01.637
"PLATFORM 9 3/4"?

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:04.205
BUT, HAGRID, THERE
MUST BE A MISTAKE.

00:00:04.248 --> 00:00:06.511
THIS SAYS PLATFORM 9 3/4.

00:00:06.555 --> 00:00:08.905
THERE'S NO SUCH THING...
IS THERE?

00:00:16.478 --> 00:00:18.219
[BELL CHIMES]

00:00:22.136 --> 00:00:24.138
[INDISTINCT P.A. ANNOUNCEMENT]

00:00:28.316 --> 00:00:29.360
SORRY.

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:34.626
EXCUSE ME.
EXCUSE ME.

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:36.280
RIGHT ON YOUR LEFT,
MADAM.

00:00:36.324 --> 00:00:37.412
EXCUSE ME, SIR.

00:00:37.455 --> 00:00:38.674
CAN YOU TELL ME
WHERE I MIGHT FIND

00:00:38.717 --> 00:00:40.067
PLATFORM 9 3/4?

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:41.633
9 3/4?

00:00:41.677 --> 00:00:42.852
THINK YOU'RE BEIN'
FUNNY, DO YOU?

00:00:42.896 --> 00:00:44.114
Mrs. Weasley:
IT'S THE SAME EVERY YEAR.

00:00:44.158 --> 00:00:46.377
PACKED WITH MUGGLES,
OF COURSE. COME ON.

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:47.596
MUGGLES?

00:00:47.639 --> 00:00:48.858
Mrs. Weasley:
PLATFORM 9 3/4 THIS WAY.

00:00:55.778 --> 00:00:58.389
ALL RIGHT, PERCY.
YOU FIRST.

00:01:09.009 --> 00:01:10.314
FRED, YOU NEXT.

00:01:10.358 --> 00:01:11.968
HE'S NOT FRED, I AM!

00:01:12.012 --> 00:01:13.056
HONESTLY, WOMAN.

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:14.710
YOU CALL YOURSELF
OUR MOTHER.

00:01:14.753 --> 00:01:16.320
OH, I'M SORRY, GEORGE.

00:01:20.498 --> 00:01:22.936
I'M ONLY JOKING.
I AM FRED.

00:01:28.593 --> 00:01:29.943
EXCUSE ME!

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:35.339
C-COULD YOU
TELL ME HOW TO--

00:01:35.383 --> 00:01:37.559
HOW TO GET
ONTO THE PLATFORM?

00:01:37.602 --> 00:01:38.952
YES, NOT TO WORRY, DEAR.

00:01:38.995 --> 00:01:41.780
IT'S RON'S FIRST TIME
TO HOGWARTS AS WELL.

00:01:41.824 --> 00:01:43.347
NOW, ALL YOU'VE
GOT TO DO

00:01:43.391 --> 00:01:45.872
IS WALK STRAIGHT
AT THE WALL

00:01:45.915 --> 00:01:47.830
BETWEEN PLATFORMS 9 AND 10.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:49.745
BEST DO IT AT A BIT
OF A RUN IF YOU'RE NERVOUS.

00:01:49.788 --> 00:01:51.399
GOOD LUCK.

00:02:23.561 --> 00:02:26.434
[TRAIN WHISTLE BLOWS]

00:02:48.717 --> 00:02:49.853
Ron: EXCUSE ME.
DO YOU MIND?
